    "body": "## Motivation\n\nClarify the distinction between prefill context parallelism (PCP), tensor parallelism (TP), and decode context parallelism (DCP), and simplify the existing prefill CP documentation.\n\n## Modifications\n\n- Remove the page description sentence.\n- Replace the introductory comparison with a shorter explanation of TP head/weight partitioning, PCP prompt-token partitioning, and DCP KV-cache partitioning.\n- Explicitly state that PCP and DCP are independent optimizations for different inference phases.\n- Remove the decode/target-verification sentence from the speculative-decoding subsection.\n- Remove \"(Experimental)\" from the CUDA graphs subsection heading, leaving the compatibility details unchanged.\n\nOnly `docs/docs/advanced_features/prefill_cp.mdx` is changed. Based on main at `166b4ae7fcd`.\n\n## Accuracy Tests\n\n- `pre-commit run --files docs/docs/advanced_features/prefill_cp.mdx`\n- `git diff --check`\n- `mint validate`\n- `mint broken-links`\n- Checked all four requested wording changes.\n\nNo GPU inference tests: documentation-only change.\n\n## Speed Tests and Profiling\n\nNot applicable; no runtime changes.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Formatting checks passed.\n- [x] Documentation updated.\n- [x] Documentation build and link checks passed.\n- Unit tests and GPU benchmarks are not applicable to this wording-only change.\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:white_check_mark: [Run #38217244340](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38217244340)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #38217243774](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38217243774)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:heavy_minus_sign: **No AMD PR run found for this commit**.<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
